# @name: redis | Execute Lua Script
# @description: Executes a Lua script Group: Redis Transaction Operations. Template: replace placeholders before running. {script} = Lua script to execute | {numkeys} = Number of keys [default "0"] | {key1} = First key | {key2} = Second key | {arg1} = First argument | {arg2} = Second argument
EVAL "{script}" {numkeys} {key1} {key2} {arg1} {arg2}